    "multicolumn_gQT4Hg": {
      "type": "multicolumn",
      "blocks": {
        "column_zFbyx4": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Policy & Procedures",
            "title_size": "h3",
            "text": "<p>Everything you need to know about Orenda policies, your responsibilities as a Distributor, and how to promote your business.<\/p><p>Updated: 1\/1\/2018<\/p>",
            "button_label": "View Document",
            "button_link": "https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0100\/9549\/3201\/files\/G020_V2.0_012018_Policies_and_Procedures_Booklet_FA_spreads_web_copy.pdf?v=1725054299",
            "button_style_secondary": false
          }
        },
        "column_9Jt6q4": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Earnings Disclosure Statement",
            "title_size": "h3",
            "text": "<p>Transparent, trustworthy business practices are important to you and to Orenda International. That’s why we’re providing up-to-date numbers to keep your business on track! The <a href=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0100\/9549\/3201\/files\/2023_CONSUMER_NOTICE_OF_INCOME_AVERAGES_52024.pdf?v=1725054885\" target=\"_blank\">Notice of Income Averages <\/a>Disclosure Statement is a great way to illustrate what someone can reasonably expect to earn in her or his Orenda International business. Orenda International makes no guarantees of income, as such representations may be misleading. Your success depends on several factors, including, but not limited to, time, effort, expertise, leadership, the target market, and how effectively you exercise those qualities.<\/p><p>Updated: 5\/2024<\/p>",
            "button_label": "View document",
            "button_link": "https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0100\/9549\/3201\/files\/2023_CONSUMER_NOTICE_OF_INCOME_AVERAGES_52024.pdf?v=1725054885",
            "button_style_secondary": false
          }
        },
        "column_JBUYwc": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Partner Agreement",
            "title_size": "h3",
            "text": "<p>Understand the terms and conditions required for all Orenda Independent Marketing Partners.<\/p><p>Updated: 1\/2023<\/p>",
            "button_label": "View Document",
            "button_link": "https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0100\/9549\/3201\/files\/PartnerAgreementForm_fill_vr5_012023.pdf?v=1725056160",
            "button_style_secondary": false
          }
        },
        "column_GQz7kc": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Preferred Customer Agreement",
            "title_size": "h3",
            "text": "<p>Understand the terms and conditions required for all Orenda Preferred Customers.<\/p><p>Updated: 2\/2022<\/p>",
            "button_label": "View Document",
            "button_link": "https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0100\/9549\/3201\/files\/Orenda-International-Preferred-Customer-Agreement_v2.0-22022.pdf?v=1725056320",
            "button_style_secondary": false
          }
        },
        "column_cmnAAL": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Social Marketing Guidelines",
            "title_size": "h3",
            "text": "<p>Simple tips for correct reporting and sharing Orenda online.<\/p><p>Updated: 11\/1\/2021<\/p>",
            "button_label": "View Guidelines",
